{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "At Zugata.com, we setup demo docker boxes for our customers to play around in to get a feel for how our product works with a set of randomly generated data.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/fe7c3e23030064812755104ce119160aba99ff2c75b0aef6ad555db62a0fbd1e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [2, 1.58, 1.64], [4, 1.98, 2.24], [5, 2.24, 2.56], [6, 2.56, 2.96], [7, 2.96, 3.22], [8, 3.22, 3.34], [9, 3.34, 3.8], [10, 3.8, 4.12], [11, 4.12, 4.34], [12, 4.34, 4.58], [13, 4.58, 4.78], [14, 4.78, 4.92], [15, 4.92, 5.06], [16, 5.06, 5.16], [17, 5.16, 5.38], [18, 5.38, 5.64], [19, 5.64, 5.82], [20, 5.82, 5.92], [21, 5.92, 6.24], [22, 6.24, 6.66], [23, 6.66, 7.0], [24, 7.0, 7.14], [25, 7.14, 7.3], [26, 7.3, 7.48], [27, 7.48, 7.8], [28, 7.8, 8.32], [29, 8.32, 8.72]]}, {"text": "This gives them a taste of the power Zugata gives employees and HR departments for driving employee development.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/55d35076d4f9fe388849224a1d4d1837f6a4cb2bd833e431dcaf2e23e07efd50.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 0.86], [4, 0.86, 1.08], [5, 1.08, 1.32], [6, 1.32, 1.44], [9, 2.3, 2.52], [10, 2.52, 3.0], [11, 3.0, 3.32], [12, 3.32, 3.62], [13, 3.62, 4.16], [14, 4.16, 4.48], [15, 4.48, 4.82], [16, 4.82, 5.3], [17, 5.3, 5.82]]}, {"text": "In order to keep our authentication secure, we require all of our staff to authenticate with Google oAuth into our internal firewall protected admin panel.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e3a8ceade32d291ce7206be04c9db6731d8b8fd5e5f554216f8ae1ff36e349c2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 0.8], [4, 0.8, 1.06], [5, 1.06, 1.46], [6, 1.46, 2.2], [7, 2.52, 2.58], [8, 2.58, 2.86], [9, 2.86, 3.18], [10, 3.18, 3.32], [11, 3.32, 3.4], [12, 3.4, 3.64], [13, 3.64, 3.86], [14, 3.86, 4.38], [15, 4.38, 4.62], [16, 4.62, 4.92], [18, 5.38, 5.96], [19, 5.96, 6.18], [20, 6.18, 6.5], [21, 6.5, 6.88], [22, 6.88, 7.44], [23, 7.44, 7.82], [24, 7.82, 8.24]]}, {"text": "This forces better security practices for all of our employees and provides better protection of our customer’s data, even for our demo instances with fake data.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f2204059a9ccaf2adf46e42724aed06a82e0e33c11677806f482f10a6ea08d82.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.62], [2, 0.62, 0.9], [3, 0.9, 1.4], [4, 1.4, 1.82], [5, 1.82, 2.18], [6, 2.18, 2.36], [7, 2.36, 2.5], [8, 2.5, 2.6], [9, 2.6, 3.04], [10, 3.04, 3.42], [11, 3.42, 3.7], [12, 3.7, 4.04], [13, 4.04, 4.52], [14, 4.52, 4.84], [15, 4.84, 4.94], [16, 4.94, 5.3], [18, 6.24, 6.44], [19, 6.44, 6.62], [20, 6.62, 6.72], [21, 6.72, 6.98], [22, 6.98, 7.56], [23, 7.56, 8.12], [25, 8.4, 8.78]]}, {"text": "Since each demo instance gets its own unique subdomain, we found we were constantly logging into the Google API console and adding each new subdomain to the redirect_url whitelist for google to let us into the admin interface of the domain.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5fcfa0a6f5733da163dcb48e5b32565769e4f847582898a2cd77d2a70b9d90d9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.4], [1, 0.4, 0.68], [2, 0.68, 0.92], [3, 0.92, 1.28], [4, 1.28, 1.62], [5, 1.62, 1.88], [6, 1.88, 1.98], [7, 1.98, 2.28], [8, 2.28, 2.88], [9, 3.4, 3.46], [10, 3.46, 3.72], [11, 3.72, 3.9], [12, 3.9, 4.0], [13, 4.0, 4.44], [14, 4.44, 4.94], [15, 4.94, 5.3], [16, 5.3, 5.42], [17, 5.42, 5.66], [18, 5.66, 6.0], [19, 6.0, 6.6], [20, 6.6, 7.06], [21, 7.06, 7.36], [22, 7.36, 7.68], [23, 7.68, 7.86], [24, 7.86, 8.46], [25, 8.46, 8.66], [26, 8.66, 8.78], [29, 10.56, 10.98], [30, 10.98, 11.24], [31, 11.24, 11.48], [32, 11.48, 11.64], [33, 11.64, 11.82], [34, 11.82, 12.06], [35, 12.06, 12.26], [36, 12.26, 12.5], [37, 12.5, 12.94], [38, 12.94, 13.2], [39, 13.2, 13.28], [40, 13.28, 13.56]]}, {"text": "Google is very particular about what domains it is willing to redirect back to and it does not support wild cards, even for subdomains.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ec0dd46d5f7f1d534269c1fd097db44a8b0bc9a8fea6fffc4f0306af9151e787.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 1.26], [4, 1.26, 1.56], [5, 1.56, 1.76], [6, 1.76, 2.1], [7, 2.1, 2.34], [8, 2.34, 2.46], [9, 2.46, 2.62], [10, 2.62, 2.9], [11, 2.9, 3.18], [12, 3.18, 3.56], [13, 3.56, 3.8], [14, 3.96, 4.06], [15, 4.06, 4.16], [16, 4.16, 4.28], [17, 4.28, 4.46], [18, 4.46, 4.84], [21, 5.86, 6.16], [22, 6.16, 6.34]]}, {"text": "To get around Google’s limitation, we setup the subdomain login.sampledomain.com and added that to the Google white list.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8158d9b567cc2dfe63132f011f3f2c32aceb5e1b45e0106c6fdf921b1787af7a.mp3"}, {"text": "On a top level, how this works is:", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b54682e32ba9f82e9cfa010747ac626407e52ade17bb7d295fdb3724c6baf216.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.26, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.5], [3, 0.5, 0.84], [4, 0.84, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.26], [6, 1.26, 1.56], [7, 1.56, 2.0]]}, {"text": "User tries to login into demo1.sampledomain.com", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ca26b1486cc0a4314355061d23a92ac70293bbc56083f99618d65034ce833967.mp3"}, {"text": "Get redirected to Google with the state variable set to demo1 (our subdomain)", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b0b7b572c24352a79b8b77ccfd5cccafa72f4fe5d3abe48390949f4dcf0271a2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.88], [2, 0.88, 1.02], [3, 1.02, 1.26], [4, 1.26, 1.52], [5, 1.52, 1.62], [6, 1.62, 1.86], [7, 1.86, 2.2], [8, 2.2, 2.52], [9, 2.52, 2.7], [11, 3.42, 3.62], [12, 3.62, 4.22]]}, {"text": "Authenticates", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f3001d1eb0d98419f5cfa2421c273c9fe5e399e14201e58c837cb9b05933a3ad.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.9]]}, {"text": "Google redirects back to login.sampledomain.com", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/00afc73217c32fcf4dd528f5bac2bb00d4e669cafb2b642cc51baeb7e5db0f0c.mp3"}, {"text": "login.sampledomain.com?auth_params...", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/84ee7354c84fab5ae3c2d3deedd3f1504918bafcdffa34f03eeb305b6a31d425.mp3"}, {"text": "redirects to demo1.sampledomain.com?auth_params...", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/293612e4544233a3bf3ceaf5eb533683bb4f1a246e4c8607ff77311fdff18ae0.mp3"}, {"text": "How to build it with simple nginx config", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3ed6f6cdda2de126eee43afd5d2f5779f1663934248e3e4624003867b270ab19.mp3"}, {"text": "nginx is really powerful and it lets you do some pretty interesting things with urls without much coding knowledge or an application layer managing the requests.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8ddaea538d3a72127a0e5f22145173b76b4978327c9d4e6b3101b702da413281.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.62, 0.72], [2, 0.72, 0.98], [3, 0.98, 1.48], [4, 1.48, 1.94], [5, 1.94, 2.06], [6, 2.06, 2.14], [7, 2.14, 2.36], [8, 2.36, 2.48], [9, 2.48, 2.64], [10, 2.64, 2.92], [11, 2.92, 3.4], [12, 3.4, 3.68], [13, 3.68, 3.9], [15, 4.32, 4.7], [16, 4.7, 5.02], [17, 5.02, 5.28], [18, 5.28, 5.68], [19, 5.68, 5.92], [20, 5.92, 6.06], [21, 6.06, 6.56], [22, 6.56, 6.86], [23, 6.86, 7.3], [24, 7.3, 7.56], [25, 7.56, 7.86]]}, {"text": "Add the following lines to your the conf on your nginx machine", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f726c1b489a661fbfb9fa48744e01df1b32268e238e04b9801a5d08479d99141.mp3"}, {"text": "When a user hits http://login.sampledomain.com?state=demo1 it will do a temporary redirect to http://demo1.sampledomain.com/users/oauth/google_oauth2/callbacks?state=demo1, keeping all of the params of the original request and passing them onto the demo instance specified in the state argument.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/9784d9b33a54428a4b3c623c2327370f907f0d5a8f424d1834b29dd480c088a2.mp3"}, {"text": "This kicks the user back to the correct demo subdomain with the authentication params and lets the server authenticate the user.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/27432ebbe89e573316453719d0f827f480e0cdc70eb904336e3630eeebaac7cc.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.76], [3, 0.76, 1.0], [4, 1.0, 1.28], [5, 1.28, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 1.56], [7, 1.56, 1.8], [8, 1.8, 2.2], [10, 2.88, 3.24], [11, 3.24, 3.4], [12, 3.4, 3.98], [14, 3.98, 5.02], [15, 5.02, 5.2], [16, 5.2, 5.4], [17, 5.4, 5.64], [18, 5.64, 6.22], [19, 6.22, 6.4], [20, 6.4, 6.68]]}, {"text": "Caveat", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/60deca7f8f937fb79a52d5bb14f92603408f79f18ea6ac0c263a1fed85d1286a.mp3"}, {"text": "Because this is making use of the state variable in the oauth request, a better implementation would also include random characters stored on the session to prevent any redirection attacks along with the domain name.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e7182522356305cf699dfe54cfd608e258f940609cddeeb665c534d049eb7885.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 0.82], [4, 0.82, 1.08], [5, 1.08, 1.2], [6, 1.2, 1.3], [7, 1.3, 1.52], [8, 1.52, 1.94], [9, 1.94, 2.24], [10, 2.24, 2.38], [12, 2.74, 3.08], [13, 3.7, 3.84], [14, 3.84, 4.04], [15, 4.04, 4.78], [16, 4.78, 5.04], [17, 5.04, 5.34], [18, 5.34, 5.74], [19, 5.74, 5.98], [20, 5.98, 6.52], [21, 6.52, 6.84], [22, 6.84, 7.04], [23, 7.04, 7.16], [24, 7.16, 7.48], [25, 7.48, 7.98], [26, 7.98, 8.22], [27, 8.22, 8.52], [28, 8.52, 9.0], [29, 9.0, 9.38], [30, 9.38, 9.68], [31, 9.68, 9.88], [33, 9.96, 10.18], [34, 10.18, 10.44]]}, {"text": "So your state would look like “demo1|RANDOMLETTERS”, but that would require more advanced nginx scripting.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3742b424412cf880b1837c46485760edbd9ee226123229834256e00206528201.mp3"}]}